1
00:00:17,179 --> 00:00:18,379
Here, Zhou Meng, have some candy.

2
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,640
About you and Haizhu,

3
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,560
I know all about it.

4
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,399
Then why come looking for me?

5
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,820
I wanted to tell you

6
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,200
he didn't rat you out.

7
00:00:59,200 --> 00:00:59,840
What do you mean?

8
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,319
That night after you got drunk,

9
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:10,879
Ziwen came by.

10
00:01:13,519 --> 00:01:14,540
You think it was him?

11
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,120
I don't know.

12
00:01:20,939 --> 00:01:21,400
Then...

13
00:01:22,459 --> 00:01:23,700
did you tell the police?

14
00:01:27,819 --> 00:01:28,239
Of course not.

15
00:01:29,659 --> 00:01:30,420
If it was him,

16
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:35,319
he deserves a chance to come clean.

17
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:41,120
You said that day you didn't take it,

18
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,739
and he just believed you.

19
00:01:45,159 --> 00:01:46,319
Zhuzi can be bullheaded,

20
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:50,319
but he truly sees you as a brother.

21
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:53,180
Haizhu has this deep conviction,

22
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:54,680
a kind of foolish innocence,

23
00:01:55,219 --> 00:01:56,200
he's just stubborn as a mule.

24
00:01:56,939 --> 00:01:58,000
There's a place in his heart

25
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:00,379
that filth can never touch.

26
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,340
This time, he

27
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:16,039
saw me being wronged,

28
00:02:16,659 --> 00:02:17,680
so he lost his temper.

29
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,819
Lately, he's

30
00:02:26,259 --> 00:02:27,080
been having a rough time.

31
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,360
I...

32
00:02:35,099 --> 00:02:37,139
Can I beg you...

33
00:02:38,659 --> 00:02:39,199
Zhou Meng,

34
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:43,099
you don't need to say that.

35
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:49,879
I'm begging you,

36
00:02:51,939 --> 00:02:52,680
help him.

37
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:57,280
There was nothing we could do about that.

38
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,439
The two of us

39
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:02,819
are just ordinary people.

40
00:03:04,659 --> 00:03:06,080
This mountain

41
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:07,719
is way too big for us.

42
00:03:12,599 --> 00:03:13,819
I'm begging you,

43
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:16,699
help him.

44
00:03:17,939 --> 00:03:18,680
Please?

45
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:50,919
Sorry to bother you.

46
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:39,620
Yan'er!

47
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,500
I'm right here.

48
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:46,740
Still hiding?

49
00:04:47,740 --> 00:04:49,300
Help! Somebody help!

50
00:04:49,660 --> 00:04:50,279
Open the door!

51
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,420
Sir,

52
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,220
here are the shipyard files.

53
00:05:23,259 --> 00:05:23,740
Take a look.

54
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:27,120
These are the investigation and interrogation records.

55
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:28,959
We can pretty much confirm

56
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:30,860
that Ma Limin created a diversion,

57
00:05:30,899 --> 00:05:31,920
pulled the guards away,

58
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:33,879
conspired with Zhang Haoran,

59
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,720
stole the materials,

60
00:05:35,139 --> 00:05:36,939
and framed Zhou Meng and Liu Haizhu.

61
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,459
Get ready to close the net.

62
00:06:04,779 --> 00:06:05,439
What are you doing here?

63
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:10,540
I need to talk to you.

64
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,839
What are you doing here?

65
00:07:15,899 --> 00:07:17,240
Brother Tian! Brother Tian!

66
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:29,980
Take it off.

67
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:54,639
Hey girl, where are you taking me?

68
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:55,560
Hurry up.

69
00:07:56,019 --> 00:07:57,699
What, you into hoods?

70
00:07:58,259 --> 00:07:59,959
Whatever you like, I'm game.

71
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,939
Quit dawdling.

72
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,079
What is this place?

73
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:05,060
What's wrong, babe?

74
00:08:24,939 --> 00:08:25,740
What's the matter, girl?

75
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:27,079
Like having a crowd watching?

76
00:08:31,899 --> 00:08:33,840
Everything you and Ma Limin pulled,

77
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:34,940
every single detail,

78
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,299
confess it word for word.

79
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:38,580
Confess what?

80
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:40,779
Say it's dog eat dog?

81
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:41,799
Dong Batian,

82
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:44,679
that's not how the game is played.

83
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,159
If you want this shipment,

84
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:48,360
fine.

85
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:49,980
Challenge me to a fight.

86
00:08:50,179 --> 00:08:51,580
If you win, take the goods.

87
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,200
But what's with playing dirty?

88
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:57,580
If you don't respect the rules of Songliao,

89
00:08:57,860 --> 00:08:59,500
you won't have an easy life either.

90
00:08:59,899 --> 00:09:00,460
You hear me?

91
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,100
Those bullshit rules of yours are out of date.

92
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,940
From now on, the rules in Songliao have only one name:

93
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:07,639
Dong Batian.

94
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,019
Zhang Haoran, remember this.

95
00:09:11,299 --> 00:09:12,500
I'll leave a way out for you.

96
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,580
Kowtow today,

97
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,580
apologize and make amends to the boys,

98
00:09:16,779 --> 00:09:18,100
and I'll give you a chance to join us.

99
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,440
I don't kowtow to the living.

100
00:09:26,379 --> 00:09:27,379
How about this, Dong Batian:

101
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,080
I took a fall today.

102
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:29,840
Fine.

103
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:31,840
Let me go,

104
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:33,620
take the goods,

105
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,600
and I'll take the hit.

106
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,700
We'll call it even.

107
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:37,639
How's that?

108
00:09:42,919 --> 00:09:43,460
Brother Zhuzi,

109
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,179
on New Year's Eve,

110
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,379
they never intended to let you have a peaceful New Year.

111
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:49,220
Ma Limin planned it with him long ago.

112
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:52,200
Your men at the factory were scattered,

113
00:09:52,659 --> 00:09:53,700
and the guard was lax.

114
00:09:54,179 --> 00:09:55,320
They wanted to take advantage of the dead of night

115
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:56,620
to quietly haul the goods away.

116
00:09:57,679 --> 00:09:58,259
Liu Haizhu,

117
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:02,159
Zhou Meng was supposed to be alone on duty that night.

118
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:04,820
A female educated youth from out of town,

119
00:10:05,399 --> 00:10:06,460
with no family or connections.

120
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,679
Between over 200,000 yuan in goods

121
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,000
and her life,

122
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:13,480
what do you think this beast would choose?

123
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,940
Their analysis makes total sense.

124
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:17,340
Honestly, Liu Haizhu,

125
00:10:17,419 --> 00:10:18,559
you were lucky.

126
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,399
Because you two ran fast.

127
00:10:21,019 --> 00:10:22,059
Otherwise, standing here today

128
00:10:22,379 --> 00:10:23,419
would be your ghost.

129
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,320
Although you two managed to escape that night,

130
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:29,659
by the next day,

131
00:10:30,419 --> 00:10:32,080
the blame for stealing from inside

132
00:10:33,139 --> 00:10:34,200
would definitely fall on you two.

133
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,200
Makes perfect sense.

134
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,179
Ma Limin and I are partners.

135
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:41,360
You two crossed Ma Limin.

136
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:43,019
He told me to kill you,

137
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:44,940
so I have to kill you.

138
00:10:45,419 --> 00:10:46,220
It's only fair.

139
00:10:46,659 --> 00:10:47,159
Don't you think?

140
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:02,159
He had Sun Biao shoot at you in the cinema,

141
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,659
and almost hit Zhou Meng.

142
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,139
Now he's even dragged Zhou Meng

143
00:11:05,419 --> 00:11:07,120
into this supplies theft case.

144
00:11:08,539 --> 00:11:09,580
Your enemy is right in front of you.

145
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:10,940
The knife

146
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,279
is in your hand.

147
00:11:44,059 --> 00:11:44,580
Liu Haizhu!

148
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:45,820
Come on!

149
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,600
To make real money, you gotta deal in big stuff.

150
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:57,919
Liu Haizhu!

151
00:11:59,980 --> 00:12:01,320
I'll remember you!

152
00:12:02,899 --> 00:12:03,399
Come on!

153
00:12:04,179 --> 00:12:04,539
Bring it!

154
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,480
Liu Haizhu.

155
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:14,799
Everything is right there.

156
00:13:15,639 --> 00:13:16,440
Whatever you want to do with it,

157
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:18,460
it's up to you.

158
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,259
Whether we

159
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:27,379
send it back to the factory,

160
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,779
turn it over to the police,

161
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,100
or keep it

162
00:13:32,759 --> 00:13:33,879
so all our brothers

163
00:13:34,419 --> 00:13:35,820
are set for life,

164
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:36,740
living large together,

165
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,620
it's entirely your call.

166
00:13:43,419 --> 00:13:44,759
We can start over.

167
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,639
How we do that

168
00:13:49,419 --> 00:13:49,840
is your choice.

169
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:56,419
Bro,

170
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,759
you're letting him choose?

171
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,019
To get these goods worth over 200,000,

172
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:05,620
look at the price we paid!

173
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,960
How many of our brothers are still lying in the hospital?

174
00:14:24,799 --> 00:14:25,480
Say something!

175
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,019
Choose!

176
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:07,519
Yang Wu.

177
00:15:10,299 --> 00:15:10,980
Brothers...

178
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:14,940
I, Liu Haizhu...

179
00:15:17,059 --> 00:15:17,960
let you down.

180
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:22,980
Brother Zhuzi...

181
00:15:23,019 --> 00:15:23,840
What are you doing?

182
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,100
Daguang...

183
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:35,620
Baige...

184
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:39,799
I'm sorry.

185
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:42,360
Brother Zhuzi...

186
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:05,500
Ziwen,

187
00:16:09,179 --> 00:16:10,059
these things

188
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:12,740
aren't ours.

189
00:16:15,379 --> 00:16:16,620
Things should be

190
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,320
the way they're meant to be.

191
00:16:22,019 --> 00:16:22,740
For money,

192
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:24,139
it's not right.

193
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,080
For anything,

194
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:30,620
it's not right.

195
00:16:36,460 --> 00:16:37,059
Ziwen,

196
00:16:43,740 --> 00:16:44,539
thank you.

197
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:48,960
Stop.

198
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:25,160
I'm Feng Ziwen.

199
00:17:26,059 --> 00:17:27,000
I'm Liu Haizhu.

200
00:17:37,039 --> 00:17:37,779
Quite a party here.

201
00:17:38,339 --> 00:17:39,420
Who the hell are you?
